tuple 2 (AIMessageChunk(content='、商业机密等）需要立即迁移到后量子密码学保护之下。\n\n量子密钥分发（Quantum Key Distribution, QKD）是另一种应对量子计算威胁的技术路线。QKD利用量子态的不可克隆', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e0068-98cc-7163-ad92-06be987abb55', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 8, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:e554daa6-5e41-a2d9-202e-ee453a829dd2|model:ca3e24b0-c0d5-b9b6-59ae-72a6ca3730a0', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:e554daa6-5e41-a2d9-202e-ee453a829dd2', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})

